            "review_title": "Review at LABRI - Oriental Neo Bistro",
            "review_text": "Ray Ray Ray\nDubai, United Arab Emirates936 contributions\n0\nGreat experienced delivered by an extremely talented chef !\nApr 2022 • Business\nChef Joon Hyuk Chi is an extremely talented chef with a superb background, having previously worked in at Abysse, one of the hottest French restaurants in Tokyo.\n\nChef Chi brings his talent, experience and creativity to Hanoi at LABRI. A French bistro using Asian ingredients and flavours to invent “neo oriental” cuisine.\n\nChef Chi is also a member of la Chaîne des Rôtisseurs marking his commitment to respect for the finest form of the hospitality arts and ethical business practices.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten March 31, 2023",
